  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Anst&#xe4;llning av konsulten Claudia Rodriguez (ACIN International Corp.) for att koordinera, organisera och agera facilitator under ett antal workshops inom ramen f&#xf6;r beredning av SARECs forskningssamarbete med Honduras. Workshops behandlade universitetsreform samt akademinska samarbetspartners (fakulteter samt institutioner) inom Universidad Autsnoma de Honduras (UNAH).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The hiring of consultant Claudia Rodriguez (ACIN International Corp.) to coordinate, organise and facilitate several workshops within the assessment of SAREC Research cooperation with Honduras. The workshops were about universityreform and academic cooperation partners (faculties and departments) within the Universidad Autsnoma de Hoduras (UNAH).</narrative>
